    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#1a1c2c;--card:#2d2f4a;--accent:#ffcd75;--text:#f4f4f4;--error:#ff6b6b}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:var(--text);padding:16px}\n.card{background:var(--card);padding:24px;border:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:0;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #000;width:100%;max-width:360px}\nh1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}\nlabel{display:block;margin:12px 0 4px;font-size:16px}\ninput,select,button{width:100%;padding:10px;font-size:16px;font-family:inherit;border:2px solid var(--accent);background:#1a1c2c;color:var(--text);border-radius:0}\ninput:focus,select:focus,button:focus{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\nbutton{cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:16px}\nbutton:hover{background:#ffe08a}\nbutton:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:none}\n#result{margin-top:16px;padding:12px;background:#1a1c2c;border:2px solid var(--accent);font-size:24px;text-align:right;min-height:52px;word-break:break-all}\n#result.error{color:var(--error);border-color:var(--error)}\n[hidden]{display:none!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n<h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n<label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n<input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5.5\">\n<label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n<input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\">\n<label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n<select id=\"operation\">\n<option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n<option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n<option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n<option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n</select>\n<button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n<output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst left=document.getElementById('left');\nconst right=document.getElementById('right');\nconst op=document.getElementById('operation');\nconst res=document.getElementById('result');\nfunction calc(){\n  const a=left.value.trim(),b=right.value.trim();\n  const x=Number(a),y=Number(b);\n  res.classList.remove('error');\n  if(a===''||b===''||!isFinite(x)||!isFinite(y)){res.textContent='Error';res.classList.add('error');return}\n  let r;\n  switch(op.value){\n    case 'add':r=x+y;break;\n    case 'subtract':r=x-y;break;\n    case 'multiply':r=x*y;break;\n    case 'divide':if(y===0){res.textContent='Error';res.classList.add('error');return}r=x/y;break;\n    default:res.textContent='Error';res.classList.add('error');return;\n  }\n  if(!isFinite(r)){res.textContent='Error';res.classList.add('error');return}\n  res.textContent=String(r);\n}\ndocument.getElementById('calculate').addEventListener('click',calc);\n[left,right].forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')calc()}));\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Two-Number Calculator\n\nA tiny offline calculator with a pixel-inspired look. Enter two numbers, pick an operation, and press **Calculate**.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html` — the whole app (HTML, CSS and JavaScript in one file).\n\n## Usage\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Type a number in **Left number** and **Right number** (negatives and decimals are fine).\n3. Choose **Add**, **Subtract**, **Multiply** or **Divide**.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in an input). The result appears below.\n\n## Behavior\n- The result shows only the numeric value, or exactly `Error`.\n- Empty or non-finite inputs show `Error`.\n- Division by zero shows `Error`.\n- Negative inputs are supported.\n\n## Accessibility\n- Every control has a visible label.\n- Full keyboard support: Tab to move, Enter to calculate.\n- Clear focus, hover and pressed states.\n\n## Constraints\n- No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n- Works offline; layout adapts down to 360px wide.",
      "description": ""
    }
